### CORS Preflight - Allowed Origin (should return 204 + CORS headers)
OPTIONS http://localhost:3000/api/announcements
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization

### CORS Preflight - Allowed Origin on /:id
OPTIONS http://localhost:3000/api/announcements/2
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### CORS Preflight - Blocked Origin (should NOT have Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
OPTIONS http://localhost:3000/api/announcements
Origin: https://evil.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization

### CORS Preflight - Blocked Origin (another example)
OPTIONS http://localhost:3000/api/announcements/2
Origin: https://malicious-site.com
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET